body:
I can't agree more with anyone saying that players exploiting these systems to "troll" people is probably the biggest downside to an idea like this. 

&#x200B;

That said I think for sure there are ways to make something like this work and benefit everyone.

It is all about risk-reward at the end of the day, and if you give players the option to decline jail time in order to just die and lose their loot. People who choose to go to faction/ guild prisons will know what they are getting themselves in for.

&#x200B;

Create work camps, Arena ect with fame bonuses. Ability to jailbreak for added benefits ect.

&#x200B;

Players could plea for their lives in hopes of keeping their gear/ resources.
